    <guid isPermaLink="false">696c571bef1cf272a7fb24f1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Jan 2026 04:06:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你是否听过这样的故事：当年的那个救火铁T在多年后居然长发飘飘；曾经打死都不能脱束胸，到如今换不完的漂亮小裙子；当年只攻不守的铁1，现在似乎成了枕头公举？这一期来聊聊TP属性的流动，欢迎收听！听完节目或许你也可以0.01-0.99属性自由流动了呢？格局打开，人生不要设限！哈哈~</span></p><span></span><p><span>对了对了，我们的同名小红书账号开通了，有想私信的小伙伴可以在那里给我们发消息哈哈哈~（万一有呢）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> 主播们近况闲聊：当伴侣一方生病了……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 正片开始：拉子的属性是不是可以流动？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a>T德学院的优秀毕业T发言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> T做久了就想做P吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> 一切从对外形的探索开始……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a> 又和拉子恋姐有关系？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1568">26:08</a> 关于铁T结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1723">28:43</a> 主播的家务活之争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1898">31:38</a> 喜欢照顾人的人会变成T，还是成为了T之后更会照顾人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a> 攻，反攻，床死</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌曲分享：房东的猫《鲸鱼电台》</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果我真能学会放手</span></p><span></span><p><span>真能懂得拥有</span></p><span></span><p><span>真能平静接受</span></p><span></span><p><span>你说会变富有</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是我 拥有愚蠢的借口</span></p><span></span><p><span>也不想和命运做朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>闹闹别扭</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6720e3c334d336a475bd2f13/lr-uL63zfQsM67YP6J2SSY9aKCBW.m4a" length="44224891" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FndcHW8NToumErF3h2x2y2QFu9hE.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP19 从网聊到面基，拉子们谁没几个下酒的故事？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694b5dcd0f2ae6a867db05a0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694b5dcd0f2ae6a867db05a0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Dec 2025 03:43:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从线上交友到线下面基，大概是每个拉拉都逃不掉的必修课了吧～有的人夜半三更还在聊到小鹿乱撞，有的人见面后脚趾抠地连夜卸载软件……</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播作为中年拉拉想当年也曾在拨号上的网上闯荡江湖。多年后，那些江湖上的传说居然变成了播客里的笑谈？还不快来听听！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 这一期主播俩在海口 “面基” 时录制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> 网聊和面基是当代拉拉交友的主要方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 闲聊 or 为了找对象而聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a> 网聊发不发照片？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a> 如果对方的照片不ok，怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a> 大部分的网聊很难持久</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">13:32</a> （一个有味道的插曲……）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> 网络上的朋友更难坚持保持联系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 回征贴or 发征贴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1342">22:22</a> 网聊第二阶段：打电话，打视频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> 那些面过的基</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> 关于群面基和群聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1978">32:58</a> 一个普通话不好的人居然因为对方普通话不好而拒绝的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2141">35:41</a> 中年主播年轻的时候竟然也是帅T?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a> 最后说一个奇葩的面基故事……</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌曲分享：陈粒《虚拟》</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是我未曾拥有无法捕捉的亲昵</span></p><span></span><p><span>我却有你的吻你的魂你的心</span></p><span></span><p><span>载着我飞呀飞呀飞 越过了意义</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是我朝夕相伴触手可及的虚拟</span></p><span></span><p><span>陪着我像纸笔像自己像雨滴</span></p><span></span><p><span>看着我坠啊坠啊坠落到云里</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6720e3c334d336a475bd2f13/lkTH17w4WIZ1T0XVBX0CS0M7FuSo.m4a" length="56873410" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqgH3L4d86GTtyrGUU1jijOAfhPQ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
