  <item>
    <title>EP15 聊聊MBTI--N人和S人情侣是如何吵架的？？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6877d489a9dec92500a648a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6877d489a9dec92500a648a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Jul 2025 17:15:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不要问我们为什么这么长时间没有更新节目，问就是——我们吵架了！在吵架的空余时间，两个主播反思了各自的MBTI，虽然只有一个字母不同，却让我们这也不一样，那也不一样！</span></p><span></span><p><span>小蝴蝶（INFP）和小画家（ISFP）为何走上相爱相杀的道路？N人和S人的脑回路就注定是“版本无法兼容”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>快收听本期节目，手把手教你——如何优雅地把吵架的锅甩给 MBTI！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 因为吵架所以一再耽误了录节目，但也因为吵架才有了这一期节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">04:08</a> 主播俩的MBTI: 小蝴蝶（INFP)/ 小画家（ISFP）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="434">07:14</a> 独处获得能量的I/ 社交获得能量的E</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> 注重实感的S/ 脑洞大开的N&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1738">28:58</a> 关于荣格八维</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a> Se外倾感觉/ Si内倾感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1927">32:07</a> Ne外倾直觉/ Ni内倾直觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2007">33:27</a> Fi内倾情感/ Fe外倾情感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">43:20</a> Ti内倾思考/Te外倾思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2732">45:32</a> 秩序和计划的J/ 灵活和随性的P&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2891">48:11</a> INFP和ISFP在一起的情感建议！</span></p><span></span><p><span>一些背景知识补充（网图，侵删）：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi5fmiR8MtA_83BkcPq_YK3hbRBE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqGRDxxxfdMM94oZ-ozOf7yfhZRE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrQqJOZ2st5TlMC0BBwSVyi7unyT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>歌曲分享：阿肆、郭采洁《世界上的另一个我》</span></p><span></span><p><span>我亲爱的你啊</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们并非单枪匹马</span></p><span></span><p><span>世界那么大</span></p><span></span><p><span>风尘仆仆我会化作</span></p><span></span><p><span>天边的晚霞</span></p><span></span><p><span>我与你同在啊</span></p>]]></description>
